# Flyrank AI Internship Project

## Stack
- Runtime: Node.js LTS
- Language: JavaScript
- IDE: Cursor with AI assistance

## Conventions
- Commits follow Conventional Commits format (feat:, fix:, docs:, chore:)
- Keep functions small and well-commented
- Use clear variable names

## Behavior
- Always suggest conventional commit messages when I ask to commit
- Prefer simple, readable code over clever one-liners
- Add comments explaining the "why", not just the "what"